          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BOAR works the same with or without signal.\n\nThe connection is only for **downloading models or packs**, **searching Hugging Face** and sharing evaluation results, if you turn that on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
